invalid type: string "\n        IMX-700 is an automotive power management\n        controller.\n\n        Operating temperature:\n        -40°C to 150°C.\n\n        Input voltage:\n        24V to 60V.\n\n        Maximum output current:\n        45A.\n\n        IMX-700 is primarily used in\n        electric vehicle battery management systems.\n\n        Supplier:\n        Supplier Beta.\n        